  "document": "Love Is Love Is Love\n\"Love Is Love Is Love\" (stylized as \"LovE Is LovE Is LovE\") is a song recorded by American singer LeAnn Rimes, and the fourth release from her sixteenth studio album, \"Remnants\". Rimes co-produced the track with Darrell Brown, Mark Batson, and Niko Bolas, and co-wrote the song with Darrell Brown, Lindy Robbins and Toby Gad. The single will be featured in the 2017 American film \"Lucky Logan\", in which Rimes will have a cameo."
